Priority = 10
metadata/_sms_note = "153l: the game's camera cube for the casino boss room (tables.bin: one CameraCubeInfo naming the map tool 'teiten camera D2', CAMERA_MODE_DEFINITE_D2 at the stage's (0, 1100, -2450)). Inside this box the camera stands at the Eye marker -- 600 u (8 m) over the arena node at the -z wall, the game's point -- and looks at Mario (+ 300 u) with kindDefiniteD2.prm's chase; the stick and the L camera are dead. Move the Eye to move the camera; the box is the room (the game's cube is 300 x 600 x 300 m: the whole stage)."

